{"4822590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holoplanet Architect", "steam_appid": 4822590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4942950, 4943330], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own planet and relax with a round of Holoplanet Architect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic piece placement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tetris-like pieces on the 3D grid of a planet hologram, each containing up to nine biomes. Your score for placing them depends on their position on the planet, what other biomes they are neighboring, and many other factors. But be careful: Placing pieces on top of already existing biomes will result in  penalties that may end your run if the score dips below zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/0269c158e6ecc07bbd6fcbbc4c15c8d2.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/0269c158e6ecc07bbd6fcbbc4c15c8d2.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/0269c158e6ecc07bbd6fcbbc4c15c8d2.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you fill a side of the hologram, you level up. In doing so, you can unlock new pieces, increasing  complexity  and the possibility for higher scores as well as disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/49a5469e360e3aff68ea99184a5fdb6f.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/49a5469e360e3aff68ea99184a5fdb6f.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/49a5469e360e3aff68ea99184a5fdb6f.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some situations you will be able to collect precious coins. Use them to buy upgrades that will help you, e.g. by increasing the hologram size, letting you skip unwanted pieces or disabling them entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/3185e7b80274b3bc038afdf3b63fb907.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/3185e7b80274b3bc038afdf3b63fb907.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/3185e7b80274b3bc038afdf3b63fb907.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive high scores await</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the rate at which you are gathering points by modifying the score multiplier. This can be done by chaining good placements to increase your combo streak or buying specific upgrades. It will enable you to achieve higher scores - or instantly destroy the planet since the multiplier also applies to penalties...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/f1361ceea83edb13e1098e4ea30e8a8a.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/f1361ceea83edb13e1098e4ea30e8a8a.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/f1361ceea83edb13e1098e4ea30e8a8a.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endure events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making too many mistakes by overwriting biomes can cause bad events like a volcano eruption or a flood to happen. You must deal with them quickly in order to avoid more problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/eafb38d5a0cc7b99184282822288dd92.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/eafb38d5a0cc7b99184282822288dd92.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/eafb38d5a0cc7b99184282822288dd92.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new, hand-crafted background scenes to set the mood and customize your experience: Feel like you are studying for your exams in a futuristic city, traveling trough deep space on an interstellar vessel or working as an electronics technician on a drilling rig on ocean planet Kepler-62e.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/039b076fc90a0832715797be9046b806.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/039b076fc90a0832715797be9046b806.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/039b076fc90a0832715797be9046b806.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own planet and relax with a round of Holoplanet Architect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic piece placement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tetris-like pieces on the 3D grid of a planet hologram, each containing up to nine biomes. Your score for placing them depends on their position on the planet, what other biomes they are neighboring, and many other factors. But be careful: Placing pieces on top of already existing biomes will result in  penalties that may end your run if the score dips below zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/0269c158e6ecc07bbd6fcbbc4c15c8d2.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/0269c158e6ecc07bbd6fcbbc4c15c8d2.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/0269c158e6ecc07bbd6fcbbc4c15c8d2.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you fill a side of the hologram, you level up. In doing so, you can unlock new pieces, increasing  complexity  and the possibility for higher scores as well as disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/49a5469e360e3aff68ea99184a5fdb6f.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/49a5469e360e3aff68ea99184a5fdb6f.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/49a5469e360e3aff68ea99184a5fdb6f.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some situations you will be able to collect precious coins. Use them to buy upgrades that will help you, e.g. by increasing the hologram size, letting you skip unwanted pieces or disabling them entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/3185e7b80274b3bc038afdf3b63fb907.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/3185e7b80274b3bc038afdf3b63fb907.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/3185e7b80274b3bc038afdf3b63fb907.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive high scores await</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the rate at which you are gathering points by modifying the score multiplier. This can be done by chaining good placements to increase your combo streak or buying specific upgrades. It will enable you to achieve higher scores - or instantly destroy the planet since the multiplier also applies to penalties...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/f1361ceea83edb13e1098e4ea30e8a8a.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/f1361ceea83edb13e1098e4ea30e8a8a.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/f1361ceea83edb13e1098e4ea30e8a8a.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endure events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making too many mistakes by overwriting biomes can cause bad events like a volcano eruption or a flood to happen. You must deal with them quickly in order to avoid more problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/eafb38d5a0cc7b99184282822288dd92.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/eafb38d5a0cc7b99184282822288dd92.webm?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/eafb38d5a0cc7b99184282822288dd92.mp4?t=1788337224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new, hand-crafted background scenes to set the mood and customize your experience: Feel like you are studying for your exams in a futuristic city, traveling trough deep space on an interstellar vessel or working as an electronics technician on a drilling rig on ocean planet Kepler-62e.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4822590/extras/039b076fc90a0832715797be9046b806.poster.avif?t=1788337224\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai